# Regenerated intermediates: byte-for-byte copies of versioned RAW files, produced by the
# versioned scripts in this directory. The RESULTS are committed; these inputs are not, to
# avoid committing the same archive several times. Each is rebuilt by running its script.
CODE-VALUE-LAB/*/RAW/
REFRESH-LAB/*/RAW/
REDTEAM/_lab/
REDTEAM/_lat/
REDTEAM/DIFESA/
__pycache__/

# NOTHING ELSE IS IGNORED. An earlier version of this file excluded the probe scripts
# beginning with an underscore, including _probe_order.py -- the script behind the step-1
# headline table. An independent provenance lens found that table was produced by a harness
# that reshuffled on every glob call, and it could not check that because the script was not
# in git. Excluding a script from version control while publishing its number is exactly the
# defect this certification exists to catch. All of them are versioned now.
